                                                       "protocol":  "Serial commands: SET Z PINS, SET Z LIMITS, CALIBRATE Z \u003cleftCm\u003e \u003crightCm\u003e \u003cspeedRpm\u003e \u003ctrapezoidFlag\u003e \u003caccelerationRpmPerSecond\u003e. Firmware probes min and max with a fast touch followed by a slow touch.",
